 "Collect your share of the olive harvest": "",
 "Eighteen drachmas. Now you have something to lose. Congratulations.": "",
 "Thales and the olive presses": "",
 "Aristotle tells, in his Politics, how Thales rented every olive press before a great harvest to show that a philosopher could be rich if he cared to.": "",
