 "); addNote(": "",
 "The owl of Athena": "",
 "An Athenian silver coin from a sunken ship: Athena on one side, her owl on the other. The owl was the city’s symbol of wisdom.": "",
 "a coin from the sea floor": "",
 "Look at that barbarian. Even his tunic has legs.": "",
 "Is that a cow you’re wearing, stranger, or did it wear you?": "",
 "Blue trousers, like a Scythian. Hide the silver.": "",
 "His sandals are made of clouds. Disgraceful.": "",
 "Mother, why is that man dressed like a sack of olives?": "",
 "Barbarian! Speak Greek or keep walking.": "",
 "He smells of the sea and of strange lands.": "",
 "Someone tell him tunics are cheap in the market.": "",
 "Another barbarian. The city fills up with them every festival.": "",
 "There goes the one who brought our water back!": "",
 "Bless you, water-finder.": "",
 "Stranger! The fountain sings again thanks to you.": "",
 "My children call you the Water Barbarian. They mean it kindly.": "",
 "Figs? For you, half price. Well, three quarters.": "",
 "Thales says you have a sharp eye. High praise from him.": "",
 "Good day, friend of the fountain.": "",
 "You still dress oddly, but we like you now.": "",
 "The gods sent the drought, you sent it away. Coincidence?": "",
 "Have you eaten? You look thin for a hero.": "",
 "Look at him in a proper chiton! Almost civilised.": "",
 "Nice tunic, friend. You could pass for a Milesian.": "",
 "The barbarian dresses like us now. Next he’ll pronounce things properly.": "",
 "Now that’s a chiton! Who’s your weaver?": "",
 "My mother would approve of that tunic. She approves of nothing.": "",
 "You look like a real citizen. Walk like one, too: slower, and with a frown.": "",
 "Finally, sensible clothes. Those blue trousers frightened the goats.": "",
 "Ah, the water-finder in honest wool. The gods are pleased, probably.": "",
 "Belt it a little higher, friend. You’re not a sailor.": "",
 "With that tunic, you only need a beard and an opinion to be a philosopher.": "",
 "Looking good! If anyone asks, say you’re from Priene. Nobody checks.": "",
 "A himation suits you. Hides the knees, which is a mercy.": "",
 "Who is that? Look at his clothes.": "",
 "Keep an eye on your purse. A barbarian in the agora.": "",
 "Mother, why are his legs blue?": "",
 "Is he Persian? Scythian? Something worse?": "",
 "Don’t stare. Well, stare a bit. What is he wearing?": "",
 "Somebody fetch the archers, just in case.": "",
 "A spy, I tell you. Sent from Sardis.": "",
 "He walks like he owns the city. He doesn’t.": "",
 "Stranger! What business brings you to Athens dressed like that?": "",
 "Those shoes. Made of what, cloud?": "",
 "I’ve never seen that cut of cloak. The cow must have been very small.": "",
 "Out of the way of the barbarian, children.": "",
 "Good day, citizen.": "",
 "Hot one today, eh? Even the owls are hiding.": "",
 "Have you heard? The Assembly meets tomorrow on the Pnyx.": "",
 "Rejoice, friend!": "",
 "If you’re going up to the Acropolis, go early. The crowds are terrible.": "",
 "You look like a man who could use a cup of wine. Me too.": "",
 "Good weather for the ships at Piraeus.": "",
 "Is it true the Milesians eat eels raw? You look like you’d know.": "",
 "Athena keep you, friend.": "",
 "Off to hear the philosophers? Bring patience.": "",
 "Fine day to be Athenian.": "",
 "Get down from there! This isn’t a goat pen.": "",
 "Look, a barbarian who climbs like a goat.": "",
 "If you fall, I’m not carrying you.": "",
 "Is the ground not good enough for you?": "",
 "My crates are not a staircase!": "",
 "Even cats have more sense.": "",
 "The gods put us on the ground for a reason.": "",
 "Careful, the last one up there was a goat.": "",
 "Climbing won’t make you taller in Athens.": "",
 "Looking for the gods up there?": "",
 "Swimming with your clothes on? A true philosopher.": "",
 "The fish are laughing at you.": "",
 "Poseidon will want rent for that.": "",
 "Did your boat sink, or your brain?": "",
 "Swim faster, the fish are bored.": "",
 "Is that how barbarians bathe?": "",
 "He swims like a sack of grain.": "",
 "Don’t drink it, it’s full of sailors.": "",
 "If you find my sandal down there, it’s mine.": "",
 "You’re dripping on my street.": "",
 "Did you fall in, or did the sea spit you out?": "",
 "Wet as a sponge diver and twice as smelly.": "",
 "Stand in the sun, barbarian, you’ll dry like a fig.": "",
 "Shake it off somewhere else!": "",
 "Look at him, a drowned philosopher.": "",
 "Even my dog dries faster than you.": "",
 "Was that your bath for the year?": "",
 "You squelch when you walk. Charming.": "",
 "Careful, you’ll rust those strange shoes.": "",
 "My amphora! Who is going to pay for that?": "",
 "Hey! That was full of oil!": "",
 "Barbarian! Smashing things like a drunk Spartan!": "",
 "Do you break everything you touch?": "",
 "That crate was my livelihood!": "",
 "Archers! He is wrecking the stalls!": "",
 "Clean that up, stranger!": "",
 "Pots don’t grow on trees, you know.": "",
 "Help! The barbarian has gone mad!": "",
 "Archers! Somebody call the archers!": "",
 "Stop him!": "",
 "Grab him, he hit a citizen!": "",
 "Run, everyone!": "",
 "Not in the Agora, you animal!": "",
 "Get him!": "",
 "I knew those trousers meant trouble!": "",
 "Somebody fetch a stick!": "",
 ")) quip(": "",
 "Hit a philosopher? You’d only make me famous.": "",
 "I’ve been hit by better men. Well, by men.": "",
 "Ow, ow, ow. Solid marble. Noted.": "",
 "That was a terrible idea.": "",
 "My foot. My poor foot.": "",
 "Right. Stone wins.": "",
 "Stop! No brawling in the city!": "",
 "Seize that barbarian!": "",
 "A brawl! Finally, honest behaviour in Miletus.": "",
 "I’ll stand over here and pretend I don’t know you.": "",
 "Punching people is the opposite of philosophy. Mostly.": "",
