 "Things have calmed down": "",
 "Acheron accepts no refunds": "",
 "Charon rowed you across the river of woe. He charged one obol. You offered him a phone.": "",
 "Dipped in the Styx": "",
 "It made Achilles invulnerable. It made you very, very wet.": "",
 "The river of wailing": "",
 "The Cocytus is full of lamentation. Yours was the loudest, and the most bubbly.": "",
 "Wrong river": "",
 "The Phlegethon is a river of fire. You still managed to drown in it.": "",
 "A long sip of Lethe": "",
 "You drank from the river of forgetfulness. Apparently you forgot how to breathe.": "",
 "Good boy, Cerberus": "",
 "Three heads, one opinion: the living don’t get in. Congratulations, you qualify.": "",
 "Minos, Aeacus and Rhadamanthus have questions": "",
 "Cause of death: forgot that lungs need air. Verdict: barbarian. Sentence: try again.": "",
 "Welcome to Tartarus": "",
 "The deepest pit of Hades. Sisyphus waves. He’d shake your hand, but he’s busy with a rock.": "",
 "Tantalus says hello": "",
 "Water up to his chin, fruit just out of reach. You, meanwhile, are just out of luck.": "",
 "Sisyphus has a spare boulder": "",
 "Tartarus is for those who offend the gods. Punching bakers counts.": "",
 "The gods are not impressed": "",
 "Tartarus is reserved for the truly wicked. They made an exception for the truly clumsy.": "",
 "Deeper than Hades": "",
 "Tartarus lies as far below Hades as the sky is above the earth. You found the shortcut.": "",
 "Zeus has filed a complaint": "",
 "Those who offend the gods end up in Tartarus. So do barbarians who start fights in the Agora.": "",
